    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Ophthalmology is a complex field that demands incredibly accurate hand-eye coordination and extremely fine motor skills for handling microsurgical instruments. This is where simulation plays a crucial role in training. Our residents gradually learn surgical manoeuvres on simulators available at CIME, the only simulation training centre for Cataract and Vitreoretina surgery in Pakistan. Our residents learn surgical techniques and complete procedures on simulator by practicing again and again at increasing levels of difficulty, with thousands of new challenging simulated scenarios and complications to make each experience unique.",
